!LAUNCH: $VIDJIL_DIR/$EXEC --all -g $VIDJIL_DIR/germline -2 $VIDJIL_DATA/chimera-fake-VJ.fa

$ The KmerSegmenter segments the five chimera reads on PSEUDO_MAX12 germline (-2)
1:unexpected .* -> .* 5

$ The FineSegmenter gives the locus information (-2)
f1:Unexpected [+]TRBV/[+]TRGJ
f1:Unexpected [+]TRDV/[+]IGHJ
f1:Unexpected [+]TRDV/[-]IGKV
f1:Unexpected [-]IGLJ.down/[+]TRGJ

$ The FineSegmenter gives the locus information (-2) and takes the best strand
f1:Unexpected [+]IGKV/[+]IGLJ

$ The FineSegmenter correclty segments the three sequences (-2)
f1:IGKV1-12.01 0//0 IGLJ1.01
f1:TRBV1.01 0//0 TRGJ1.01
f1:TRDV1.01 0//0 IGHJ1.01

$ The FineSegmenter correclty segments the two sequences with either V or J reversed (-2)
f1:TRDV1.01 0//0 IGKV1-12.01
f1:IGLJ1.01 0//0 TRGJ1.01
